so Jambi    ∙ / Wikimedia Commons / Public domain","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2004_Indian_Ocean_earthquake_and_tsunami","images/a0d0b4880d71673d61d74d6fd41f94283ccd4963.webp",{"_29":145,"_75":146},[144],{"_29":68,"_69":70},{"_27":125,"_66":126},{"_27":91,"_29":92},"Indonesia","Asia","590","Treaty of Asunción","An agreement aimed at promoting economic integration and cooperation among member countries in South America.","The treaty laid the groundwork for future regional cooperation and economic partnerships.",1991,26,"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Treaty_of_Asunci%C3%B3n",{"_29":158,"_75":159},[],{"_29":68,"_69":70},{"_27":65,"_66":67},"Paraguay","SouthAmerica","244","The Rise of the Internet","The introduction of the World Wide Web revolutionized communication, commerce, and information sharing worldwide.","https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Internet_map_1024_-_transparent%2C_inverted.png/330px-Internet_map_1024_-_transparent%2C_inverted.png","The Opte Project / Wikimedia Commons / CC BY 2.5","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_the_Internet","images/5a573cd9ae5aa2e6587ed4abc47ffc23aa5ae570.webp",{"_29":74,"_75":74},[171],{"_29":68,"_69":70},{"_27":65,"_66":67},{"_27":172,"_29":173},"3","culture","1467","Launch of the Hubble Space Telescope","The Hubble Space Telescope was launched into low Earth orbit, marking a significant advancement in space observation technology.","The telescope continues to operate, providing invaluable data and images of the universe.",1990,24,"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/HST-SM4.jpeg/330px-HST-SM4.jpeg","Image: Hubble Space Telescope / Wikimedia Commons","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hubble_Space_Telescope",{"_29":188,"_75":189},[187],{"_29":68,"_69":70},{"_27":65,"_66":67},{"_27":72,"_29":73},"United States of America","NorthAmerica","1219","The Rise of the Digital Economy","period","A transformative period marked by the rapid growth of the internet and digital technologies, reshaping how businesses operate and consumers interact.","The period continues as digital technologies evolve and influence global economic structures.",0.85,"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Davos_2015_-_The_Future_of_the_Digital_Economy.webm/320px--Davos_2015_-_The_Future_of_the_Digital_Economy.webm.jpg","Image: Digital economy / Wikimedia Commons","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Digital_economy",{"_29":74,"_75":74},[],{"_29":68,"_69":70},{"_27":65,"_66":67},"1204","The Washington Consensus","A set of ten economic policy prescriptions aimed at promoting economic growth in developing countries, emphasizing free-market principles.","The period concluded as critiques emerged regarding the effectiveness of these policies in achieving sustainable development.",1989,2001,0.7,0.5,"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washington_Consensus",{"_29":74,"_75":74},[],{"_29":68,"_69":70},{"_27":65,"_66":67},"440","Pacific Islands Forum","The Pacific Islands Forum is an intergovernmental organization that aims to enhance cooperation between Pacific island countries.","It plays a crucial role in addressing regional issues and promoting sustainable development.",1971,"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Flag_of_the_Pacific_Islands_Forum.svg/330px-Flag_of_the_Pacific_Islands_Forum.svg.png","Zoltán Horváth / Wikimedia Commons / Public domain","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pacific_Islands_Forum","images/b4cfedf3e25fe110854c552b642687a6f8488fc8.webp",{"_29":74,"_75":74},[229],{"_29":68,"_69":70},{"_27":65,"_66":67},{"_27":109,"_29":110},"357","Antarctic Treaty","The Antarctic Treaty was signed to regulate international relations and ensure that Antarctica is used for peaceful purposes and scientific research.","This treaty has been pivotal in maintaining peace and cooperation among nations in Antarctica.",1961,6,23,"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Flag_of_the_Antarctic_Treaty.svg/330px-Flag_of_the_Antarctic_Treaty.svg.png","Alakasam . / B1mbo / Wikimedia Commons / CC BY-SA 3.0","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antarctic_Treaty","images/f4ee21701ea2cdd1adb1312a32cec00f5539a052.webp",{"_29":247,"_75":247},[245,246],{"_29":68,"_69":70},{"_27":65,"_66":67},{"_27":109,"_29":110},{"_27":91,"_29":92},"Antarctica",[],"subject",[],[],"yearStart",-300000,"yearEnd","search","sortBy",true,40]
